or a monthly ledger\n- note 26: rounding differences under 1.00 are not mismatches\n- note 27: the verifier check consistency-1 covers totals\n- note 28: consistency-2 covers row counts\n- note 29: consistency-3 covers the FX rate\n- note 30: consistency-4 covers date ranges\n- note 31: answer with the count and the total on one line\n- note 32: if a search returns no rows, retry with the id prefix only\n- note 33: grep the directory before reading any file\n- note 34: the README often names the schema file\n- note 35: a fixture that freezes the clock explains a DST edge\n- note 36: the runner config explains a CI-only failure\n- note 37: the client is wrong when it sends lower-case codes\n- note 38: the server change is breaking when the contract was not updated\n- note 39: roll back to the last held rollout percentage\n- note 40: an index on created_at fixes a nightly report",
